{"id":"nachistotu","lemma":"начистоту","pos":"adv","rank":3584,"glosses":["openly, frankly, without equivocation"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/32/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она говорит начистоту.","en":"She speaks frankly.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"Давайте начистоту.","en":"Let's put all the cards on the table.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274797","words":[{"g":"to let"},null]},{"text":"Давай поговорим начистоту.","en":"Let's talk turkey.","words":[{"g":"let's"},{"g":"to have a conversation","l":"поговорить"},null]},{"text":"Ты действительно хочешь, чтобы я говорил начистоту?","en":"Do you really want me to be frank?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"Скажи начистоту.","en":"Tell me frankly.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]}]}